<Namespace Name="Android.Media.Metrics">
  <Docs>
    <summary>Provides media session identifiers, metric reports, and playback and editing events.</summary>
    <remarks>
      <para>Use <see cref="Android.Media.Metrics.MediaMetricsManager" /> to create a metrics session. Use the event and report builders to supply measurements, then pass the result to the corresponding session reporting method.</para>
      <para><see cref="Android.Media.Metrics.LogSessionId" /> identifies a session and can associate it with lower-level media components. Event timestamps are elapsed milliseconds since creation of the associated log session, not wall-clock timestamps. Close a session to release its identifier.</para>
      <para>Source: <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/99b01a65cc4c104933788b3143285ab6bae65827/media/java/android/media/metrics/MediaMetricsManager.java">Android implementation</a></format>.</para>
      <para>Source: <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/99b01a65cc4c104933788b3143285ab6bae65827/media/java/android/media/metrics/PlaybackSession.java">Android implementation</a></format>.</para>
      <para>Source: <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/99b01a65cc4c104933788b3143285ab6bae65827/media/java/android/media/metrics/Event.java">Android implementation</a></format>.</para>
      <para>Source: <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/94b4c163b7dfe5ce3607f7bb8456f9573f7de57d/media/java/android/media/metrics/BaseSession.java">Android implementation</a></format>.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
</Namespace>
